updated_at: "2026-11-26T15:30:18.450Z"
assignee: "harness:claude-code"
claim_principal: "harness:claude-code#bde5973a64851be416b1c911"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 45
acceptance_criteria: "The publication gate downloads the selected binding again after a bounded wait when the provider answers HTTP 404, each attempt into a fresh directory; Any other download failure, and a 404 that outlasts the wait, is refused at once with the provider's error; the downloaded file is verified exactly as before; A spec drives trailing 404 downloads, a persistent 404 and a non-404 failure through the gate and proves the waits and refusals; GH-1788 carries a root-cause comment naming this item"
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: low
confidence: high
expected_result: "A producer binding listed in the complete inventory is downloaded and verified, and the release is pushed"
actual_result: "gh run download answered HTTP 404 1.5 s after the upload finalized, and the gate refused the release"
